If the user has required authentication methods, then authentication information will be supplied to the SoftLayer_User_Customer::processPasswordSetRequest method within this same SoftLayer_Container_User_Customer_PasswordSet container.  All existing information in the container must continue to exist in the container to complete the password set/reset process. </documentation>
