      <documentation>Retrieve a user id using a password token provided to the user in an email generated by the SoftLayer_User_Customer::initiatePortalPasswordChange request. Password recovery keys are valid for 24 hours after they&amp;#039;re generated. 

When a new user is created or when a user has requested a password change using initiatePortalPasswordChange, they will have received an email that contains a url with a token.  That token is used as the parameter for getUserIdForPasswordSet.  Once the user id is known, then the SoftLayer_User_Customer object can be retrieved which is necessary to complete the process to set or reset a user&amp;#039;s password. </documentation>
